    0
   ],
   "text": "One lazy cloud dreams right across the ferry's way."
  },
  {
   "at": [
    -5,
    0,
    2
   ],
   "text": "A bell of mist rings softly, somewhere high above."
  },
  {
   "at": [
    -6,
    0,
    -1
   ],
   "text": "The path climbs on, into white silence."
  },
  {
   "at": [
    -7,
